[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5121916276","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5121916276","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5121916276,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMUo9dA","user":{"login":"DonKoutsou","id":127870401,"node_id":"U_kgDOB58lwQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127870401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou","html_url":"https://github.com/DonKoutsou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:26:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T18:29:25Z","body":"I tried the PR, thanks alot for attempting this, I can't give much help with the actual code review but I've found a bug wich I had when I was trying to fix this as well. \r\nThe mouse position of things inside subviewports seems to be affected by the window size. If the window size is anything else other that the original size the mouse position gets skewd. Can be seen by adding a simple button inside the subviewport.\r\nAlso the position recovered from `get_global_mouse_position` is also affected.\r\n\r\nAlso change does not seem to work in editor.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5121916276/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5122046139","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5122046139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5122046139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMUw4uw","user":{"login":"low-moon","id":298359369,"node_id":"U_kgDOEciaSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298359369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/low-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:38:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T18:38:37Z","body":"Ah interesting okay, I will look into this. If you found a reason for this occurring in your own testing please lmk! \r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5122046139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5122162223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5122162223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5122162223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMU3-Lw","user":{"login":"DonKoutsou","id":127870401,"node_id":"U_kgDOB58lwQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127870401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou","html_url":"https://github.com/DonKoutsou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:48:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T07:20:20Z","body":"I wont be able to deliver solid reason as to why this happens but i can share what worked for me for the mouse.\r\n\r\n- `get_screen_transform_internal` inside `viewport.cpp` should return `container_transform * get_global_canvas_transform()` instead of `container_transform * get_final_transform()`\r\n- `vewport.cpp` line 3442 calls `_update_mouse_over` on the subviewport using the value returned from `v->get_final_transform().affine_inverse().xform(pos)`, instead of that calling `_update_mouse_over` using the value `pos` created a few lines above using the canvas transform seems to help\r\n- `_send_event_to_viewports` inside `subviewport_container.cpp` pushes input to the subviewports, I added a `true` on the `push_input` to change it into local\r\n\r\nThis two seem to fix the mouse for me but haven't done excessive testing to rule out any extra bugs.\r\n\r\nI've also found another issue unfortunately. It is when using viewports the have their `Update Mode` set to `Once`. When resizing the window I think they might need to be \"redrawn\". Now they just dissappear when the window changes size.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5122162223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5146962844","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5146962844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5146962844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMshrnA","user":{"login":"low-moon","id":298359369,"node_id":"U_kgDOEciaSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298359369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/low-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:01:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:36Z","body":"Hey thanks for that information! Applying those fixes has fixed the mouse events, I'm just testing with more UI in the subviewport and looking out for any edge cases or errors. Also, I fixed the compatibility issues (the issue of moving get_size from window and subviewport to viewport), by shadowing these methods in the child classes. But I will submit this to the branch once everything is ready.\r\n\r\nNow I am just looking into why the editor is failing to render at the correct resolution, and also trying to understand further the different transforms and what is actually happening to rationalise the mouse fixes, however I expect this to take a couple days before I can consider this PR ready. Should I convert it to a draft?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5146962844/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5301586887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5301586887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5301586887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO__Lxw","user":{"login":"DonKoutsou","id":127870401,"node_id":"U_kgDOB58lwQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127870401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou","html_url":"https://github.com/DonKoutsou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-15T09:25:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T09:25:00Z","body":"I really hope this does not die here. Is there anything I can do to help this progress?\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5301586887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5333761780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5333761780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5333761780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPeq-9A","user":{"login":"low-moon","id":298359369,"node_id":"U_kgDOEciaSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298359369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/low-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T20:37:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T20:37:00Z","body":"Hey apologies, I've been very busy but this is my priority to get done now as I need it for my game. In terms of things to work on, I am currently looking at `canvas_item_editor_plugin` to figure out why the editor is not rendering the subviewport at the correct resolution. I feel like maybe `get_size` isn't reliable for getting the render resolution as it seems to modify the canvas transforms, but I need to look into it further. I also found a bug with how the original PR binds to `size_changed` so I need to fix that. I remember you wrote a draft solution for this that worked with the canvas transforms rather than the resolutions, am I okay to reference that for this PR?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5333761780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339147893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5339147893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5339147893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPjzudQ","user":{"login":"DonKoutsou","id":127870401,"node_id":"U_kgDOB58lwQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127870401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou","html_url":"https://github.com/DonKoutsou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T07:52:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T07:53:05Z","body":"> am I okay to reference that for this _PR?\r\n\r\nFeel free to use it in any way it helps you. I am not sure if its the best way forward since it also created some bugs for me but maybe you will understand what is up.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339147893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5389217066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5389217066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5389217066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQTjtKg","user":{"login":"low-moon","id":298359369,"node_id":"U_kgDOEciaSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298359369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/low-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T00:01:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T00:03:02Z","body":"Just as an update, I understand the canvas transforms and overall what is happening better, and have a list of bugs to address with this solution before it is ready. \r\nI switched from using `get_size` to getting the render scale from the parent viewport's final transform (which is a scaled version of it's global canvas transform) which now scales the subviewport as the editor zooms in, but this exposes a more logical error in that as the main viewport zooms in, the subviewport has to render at huge resolutions to appear visually consistent. I currently cap this at the rendering device's texture limit to avoid an error, but it still becomes very laggy when zoomed in to the limit. \r\nI cannot see a way to address this without faking the subviewport in some way, and following this PRs goal of making the subviewport container aware of its visual scale it is the correct behaviour, so I think this should be left for a subsequent PR to address (or the subviewport container can use the unscaled canvas transform and we allow a subviewport container to be pixelated in the canvas editor). \r\nAdditionally I am still working on the input transforms.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5389217066/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5705791296","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5705791296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5705791296,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVBd3QA","user":{"login":"low-moon","id":298359369,"node_id":"U_kgDOEciaSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298359369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/low-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T23:05:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T23:05:26Z","body":"Okay I have everything working from my testing!\r\nHere is the test project I used, I added a couple graph edit nodes to test more complex UI behaviour, and also a nested subviewport to check recursive behaviour:\r\n[subviewport-scaling-test_2026-09-16_23-40-24.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32311301/subviewport-scaling-test_2026-09-16_23-40-24.zip)\r\n\r\nThe things I found were broken and fixed were:\r\n- Editor zoom scaling\r\n- Input picking\r\n- Mouse drag in rect\r\n- UI outline (in-editor, and runtime debugger)\r\n- Tooltip scaling\r\n- size_changed binding\r\n\r\nAlso, `size_2d_override_stretch` is now enabled and read-only (along with `size_2d_override`) when `SubViewportContainer.stretch` is enabled, like the `size` property is before this PR.\r\n\r\nThis PR also no longer breaks compat. Please can people try out this PR with their projects to check for any regression or new broken behaviour that I missed in my testing, as I don't have any projects that use subviewports extensively.\r\n\r\nI think one thing that does need to be addressed before this PR is ready is the editor zoom scaling, as even with the GPU driver based texture limit, if you zoom in too far it will start lagging. I am unsure how to limit this without tying it to a hardcoded value, so instead we could force the subviewport to render at the design size when in the editor.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5705791296/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5711352457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5711352457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5711352457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVGxSiQ","user":{"login":"DonKoutsou","id":127870401,"node_id":"U_kgDOB58lwQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127870401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou","html_url":"https://github.com/DonKoutsou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T08:28:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T08:28:10Z","body":"I've tried to compile the code and the editor seems to be starting well with every project I run except for one.\r\nI am getting this crash, It could be that my build is faulty but I thought of sharing in case it means something to you.\r\n<img width=\"1626\" height=\"1093\" alt=\"εικόνα\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4aac3a31-d7b3-45bb-8a1b-b9af863c7992\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5711352457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5723076336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121903#issuecomment-5723076336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121903","id":5723076336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVR828A","user":{"login":"low-moon","id":298359369,"node_id":"U_kgDOEciaSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298359369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/low-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/low-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T00:21:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T00:21:41Z","body":"I've pushed a change to limit the subviewport scale to 1.5x the window resolution, to avoid the freezing/errors when the editor is zoomed in too far, and to fix the build errors. It may be your pr